    "text": "The transformation occurring in Duma&#39;s method is given below<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>CuO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>xCO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi></math><br />The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math> is (Integer answer)"
