    "text": "<p>Dumas method formula:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>CuO</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>xCO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>Cu</mi></math></p><p>Comparing it with the given compound&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>"
